[h1]Incest Cultural Tradition[/h1]

Two cultural traditions for dynasties that keep their blood close. Built for CK3 1.21.

An A Game of Thrones version is available: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3489760265]AGOT - Valyrian Cultural Incest Traditions[/url].

[h2]Traditions[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Family Bindings[/b]: marriage between any members of the family is allowed.
[*][b]Sibling Bonds[/b]: brothers and sisters may marry or become concubines, and relations between siblings are not treated as incest.
[/list]

Either partner's culture having the tradition is enough. Both traditions can be adopted through culture reform and hybridisation.

[h2]Works With[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3611795747]Secrets of Ambrosius[/url]: its magic decision can grant these traditions when this mod is loaded.
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
Overrides the marriage and incest checks (could_marry_character_trigger and the rite-based incest triggers), so it may conflict with other mods that change who can marry.

[h2]Feedback[/h2]
Bug reports and suggestions are always welcome.
